<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in month.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in month.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the month from September 30 to November 1, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   1.61 trillion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  1.84 trillion yen</p>
<p>    Net selling			233.64 billion yen</p>
<p>Note - All figures are rounded.</p>
</text>
